          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini nama d'aloota Harunitifi gosa worraa iraa bahe. Harunini ilmaani afuri qaba: Nadaba, Abihu, Eleazari, Ithamari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.1+LEV.10.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 10.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadabufi Abihuni, ato abbaani isani jiru, duani, ka woma ind'aliini. Tanaafi oboleyaani isaani Eleazarifi Ithamarini qaalole tahani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Daudini nama d'aloota Haruni kana ch'ufa fulla fullaati qoode huji iti kenne: Huji suni keesa, Sadoki ka d'aloota Eleazaritifi Ahimeleki ka d'aloota Ithamariti isa qarqaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'aloota Eleazari fulla kud'ani jaati gargari qoodani. Ammalle d'aloota Ithamarile fulla saddeetiti qoodani; wonti akasi qoodanifi, waan nami d'aloota Eleazari ka nad'eeni fuud'e, worra kaani d'ibi ch'ufa ira heddateefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan hujiini worra d'aloota Eleazaritifi Ithamari ta Mana Waaqatifi, ta Waaqa hojjatanileeni taka taateefi, huji suni hit'aani worraa qoodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri d'aloota Eleazaritifi ka Ithamari maro marooni hit'a suni fud'ate duuba nama fohatani, Shemaya ilma Nethaneli, ka worra Lawiti tatabe t'aafuti maqa worra t'aafa. Nami huji suni d'uga iti tahe: Hayyicha, worra huji isaati matati, qaallicha Sadoki jed'ani, Ahimeleki, ilma Abiahariti, ammalle worra worra qaaloleetifi ka Lawileeti mataa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
