              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini, hit'a suni akuma wolti aanu kaanaani argate: Yehoyaribu, Yedaya, Harimu, Seorimu, Malkia, Miyamini, Hakosi, Abiya, Yeshua, Shekania, Eliashibu, Yakimu, Hupa, Yeshebeaku, Bilga, Imeri, Heziri, Hapisesi, Pethaiya, Ezekieli, Yakini, Gamuli, Delaya, Maazia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.7+1CH.24.8+1CH.24.9+1CH.24.10+1CH.24.11+1CH.24.12+1CH.24.13+1CH.24.14+1CH.24.15+1CH.24.16+1CH.24.17+1CH.24.18",
