          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mali, Mushi, Yaasi, worri kunini ilmaani Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaasini ilmaani sadi qaba: Shohamu, Zakuri, Ibri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malini ilmaani lama qaba, Eleazarifi Kishi. Eleazarini ilma inqabu, ammo Kishini ilma toko qaba, ka Yerameeli jed'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.28+1CH.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.28",
              "1CH.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushini ilmaani sadi qaba: Mali, Ederi, Yeremothi. Worri kunini nama d'aloota Lawiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami hit'a suni fud'atu ch'ufti abbooti worraatifi oboleesa isaa ka maand'a ka taatefu, akuma fiit'aani worraa ta qaalole duri Harunini d'ale tolchite tolche. Nami huji suni iti d'uga tahe, hayyu Daudi, Sadoki, Ahimaleki, ammalle nama worra qaaloleetifi worra Lawiti mataa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
